{"kind": "mod", "id": 922, "name": "Less Restricting Headwear", "slug": "less-restricting-headwear", "teaser": "Removes some restrictions regarding wearing headwear: helmets, headsets, facemasks, faceshields, eyewear", "owner_name": "MusicManiac", "downloads": 131187, "favourites": 105, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "com.musicmaniac.lessrestrictingheadwear", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Equipment", "category_id": 15, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T06:06:44.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-06-15T04:44:26.000000Z", "published_at": "2023-06-15T04:44:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.0", "latest_version": "3.0.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<p>Allows you (and bots) to wear headwear with less restrictions.</p>\n<p>There are a lot of options, including removing blocks between following categories in any combination:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Helmets</li>\n<li>Headsets</li>\n<li>Facecovers</li>\n<li>Eyewear</li>\n<li>Face Shields</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Check config for details.</p>\n<p>If you wanna be true homie or say thanks for time I’ve spent modding the game, feel free to send me a coffee on kofi</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/musicmaniac\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5c14e387dab576fe667689cf/61e11d5cf697cee7ca5b65d9_Button-p-500.png\" alt=\"61e11d5cf697cee7ca5b65d9_Button-p-500.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>I effectively stopped playing SPT in favor of PvE since I can play with friends there (and no I don’t care about coop SPT mods).<br />\nI will be keeping this mod up-to-date as best as I can, however I do not follow SPT dev cycle anymore so might take some time for updates since I literally miss new SPT releases. My 3.9.X and 3.10.X updates were put up literally because someone tipped me on ko-fi and it send email to me so I was like “oh, new SPT version is up”</p>\n<p>Do not repost updates of my mods without reaching me first on SPT discord.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.4.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 750, "published_at": "2024-04-11T14:49:24.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/922/less-restricting-headwear/1.4.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 16117, "published_at": "2024-07-12T15:59:45.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/922/less-restricting-headwear/2.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 15534, "published_at": "2024-12-06T22:43:35.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/922/less-restricting-headwear/2.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.3.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 27946, "published_at": "2025-04-14T18:53:38.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/922/less-restricting-headwear/2.3.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "3.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 8445, "downloads": 56918, "published_at": "2025-10-21T21:26:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/922/less-restricting-headwear/3.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "source_code_links": []}